# id: N1-P4
# title: On issue day a citizen in town says one of the issue's top headlines, unprompted
# needs: client
# why-client: citizens say headlines only where a player stands to hear them, and the headless operator is a BotClient
#   that AgentPresence counts as a bot (run headless on 2026-11-22: 15 min in Henesys, idle lines, no headline, as designed)
# source: WORLD_SYSTEMS_PLAN.md N1 live check P4 (and "done when": a citizen mentions a headline unprompted)
# setup: run on the issue's first day (within 24 h of Sunday 00:00 GMT) after P1-issue.check, or force one first
login --character TestGm
online TestGm
queue TestGm !paper issue
expectgm is issued within 30
say !warp 100000000
# Dwelling citizens roll an idle line every 20 s; on Henesys's busy square one says a headline within minutes.
expectadmin citizens chatter ~ (?i)paper|board within 900
shot p4-headline
